        "id": 1867527
      },
      "writtenOn": "2025-03-12T03:53:31Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Sorry, I forgot to consider \"struct mem_cgroup_per_node\". What I meant is that the size of \"struct lru_gen_folio\" only affects the size of \"struct lruvec\", and the size of \"struct lruvec\" only affects the size of \"struct mem_cgroup_per_node\".\n\n\"struct mem_cgroup_per_node\" is alloc for in alloc_mem_cgroup_per_node_info() using kzalloc_node(). The size of \"struct mem_cgroup_per_node\" is 2896Byte. Due to alignment reasons, the memory size of allocate is 4KB. Adding 6 u64s will not increase the allocate size.\n\nsizeof(struct lru_gen_folio) is 1360Byte\nsizeof(struct lruvec) is 1600Byte\nsizeof(struct mem_cgroup_per_node) is 2896Byte",
      "parentUuid": "52c7183d_cd4642d5",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 16,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 19,
        "endChar": 40
      },
